  "description": "<p>With FeSL enabled, fedora.test.api.TestRISearch is failing. Queries that ask for a specific format such as \"count\" are rewritten to return RDF/XML.</p>\n\n<p>For example, the query: <br/>\n<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fedora/risearch?type=triples&amp;lang=spo&amp;format=count&amp;stream=on&amp;query=*%20*%20*\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fedora/risearch?type=triples&amp;lang=spo&amp;format=count&amp;stream=on&amp;query=*%20*%20*</a><br/>\nalways returns RDF/XML (format=Turtle, etc. is also rewritten)</p>",
